stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Issued : issueCap inserts epoch 1, revoked false, expires_at now plus one hour
    Issued --> Issued : issueCap re-issues, epoch plus 1, revoked false, expiry refreshed
    Issued --> Revoked : revokeCap sets revoked true
    Issued --> Expired : clock_timestamp reaches expires_at
    Revoked --> Issued : issueCap re-issues, epoch plus 1, revoked false, expiry refreshed
    Expired --> Issued : issueCap re-issues, epoch plus 1, revoked false, expiry refreshed
    Issued --> Deleted : confirmTimeline deletes every grant and audits cap.revoke
    Revoked --> Deleted : confirmTimeline deletes every grant and audits cap.revoke
    Expired --> Deleted : confirmTimeline deletes every grant and audits cap.revoke
    Deleted --> Issued : issueCap inserts a new grant with a new id and epoch 1
    note right of Revoked
        Commit checks revoked and denies with 403 NEEDS_APPROVAL.
    end note
    note right of Expired
        Commit checks expires_at against clock_timestamp and denies with 403 NEEDS_APPROVAL.
    end note
